msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Assault"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:18
msgid ""
"The fearsome Vindicator cruiser hull balances stout armor and forward-facing "
"weapons with a tremendous impulse engine, which grants it the sublight speed "
"of a pursuer even if it lacks the turning rate of a smaller craft.\n"
"\n"
"A skilled navigator and helms officer can use the Vindicator's jump drive "
"and impulse engine to appear at missile range, launch an array of missiles "
"as powerful as nuclear weapons, and then outrun defenders in a race while "
"its jump drive recharges. Its combat thrusters aid as much in its defensive "
"maneuverability as it does to close in on fleeing targets."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:75
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Avalanche"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:77
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Bombardment"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:82
msgid ""
"The Avalanche cruiser is a warp-capable, missile-laden vessel that carries "
"enough munitions on its own to level a system full of space stations. Its 6 "
"missile tubes cover all but its rear angles, which houses a mine-laying "
"tube.\n"
"\n"
"The Avalanche earned its moniker for being unstoppable, but also for being "
"spotted from sectors away as it races into position. If not covered by "
"escorts, its vulnerable rear shields and slow maneuverability can leave it "
"prey to smaller ships that don't fear it on sight."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:142
