msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:144
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Battlecruiser"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:144
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Superiority"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:148
msgid ""
"The Battlestation is a battlecruiser with a dozen beam emplacements, a jump "
"drive, and docking clamps to carry ships as large as frigates on its "
"exterior into battle. Its offensive capabilities are offset by a single, if "
"powerful, shield generator and a relatively fragile hull for a vessel its "
"size.\n"
"\n"
"Battlestations are meant to join large-fleet ambushes, drop their docked "
"vessels, provide coverage against retaliating starfighters, and then jump "
"out the moment the tide of battle turns in their favor. However, a barrage "
"of EMPs and HVLIs can quickly whittle it down."
msgstr ""

