#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:185
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Ender"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/cruisers.lua:188
msgid ""
"The Ender revision to the Battlestation divided its shields into two smaller "
"generators, which opened space for more capable impulse engines and "
"thrusters. These changes grant it surprising agility for a capital ship, "
"although it still handles much differently than a destroyer.\n"
"\n"
"The Ender's revisions also made space to install 2 weapon tubes, one "
"dedicated to laying mines in order to deter pursuing capital ships and "
"immediately secure territory that it helped win."
msgstr ""
